   "subject": "installing lavaan without internet connection",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi everyone,<div>I need to conduct analysis in a safe environment without internet connection and I find myself needing to install lavaan from a USB drive, but I&#39;m not sure how to do it.</div><div>Does anyone know where to find a zip file with all the required files (including dependencies) to have lavaan up and running?</div><div>Thanks in advance for your help!</div><div>Patricio</div></div>"
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "OX2d5C-FAgAJ",
   "from": "Terrence Jorgensen",
   "author": "3fe90052fbf2f899",
   "date": "2019-06-27T21:03:57Z",
   "subject": "Re: installing lavaan without internet connection",
   "parts": [
    [
     2,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div>Does anyone know where to find a zip file with all the required files (including dependencies) to have lavaan up and running?</div></div></blockquote><div><br></div><div><br></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div>Download the &quot;<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Times;font-size:medium\">Package source</span>&quot; from the CRAN site to your USB:</div><div><br></div><div><a href=\"https://cran.r-project.org/package=lavaan\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://cran.r-project.org/package%3Dlavaan&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792423489583000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1-ySB4ygeg0S92Kk7Sy6WK\">https://cran.r-project.org/package=lavaan</a><br></div><div><br></div><div>Then you can install using this syntax (assuming your USB will be drive &quot;E:&quot; on Windows; update your path if necessary):</div><div><br></div><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">install</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">packages</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;E:/lavaan_0.6-3.tar.gz&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> type </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;source&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> repos </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> NULL</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span></div></code></div><div><br><br></div><div><div><div dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gmail_signature\" data-smartmail=\"gmail_signature\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div>Terrence D. Jorgensen</div><div>Assistant Professor, Methods and Statistics</div><div>Research Institute for Child Development and Education, the University of Amsterdam</div><div><a href=\"http://www.uva.nl/profile/t.d.jorgensen\" style=\"color:rgb(17,85,204)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.uva.nl/profile/t.d.jorgensen&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792423489583000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1nhwkcIZTHhtuXO8RDN2n1\">http://www.uva.nl/profile/t.d.jorgensen</a></div></div></div></div></div><div dir=\"ltr\"><br style=\"font-size:small\"></div></div></div></div>"
    ]
   ]
  },
  {
   "id": "fcf8aUW7AgAJ",
