    [
     3,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><br><br>On Thursday, 27 June 2019 22:03:57 UTC+1, Terrence Jorgensen  wrote:<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div>Does anyone know where to find a zip file with all the required files (including dependencies) to have lavaan up and running?</div></div></blockquote><div><br></div><div><br></div><div><div>Download the &quot;<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Times;font-size:medium\">Package source</span>&quot; from the CRAN site to your USB:</div><div><br></div><div><a href=\"https://cran.r-project.org/package=lavaan\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://cran.r-project.org/package%3Dlavaan&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792423489584000&amp;usg=AOvVaw17AX6B0nj_subk165eAySD\">https://cran.r-project.org/package=lavaan</a><br></div><div><br></div><div>Then you can install using this syntax (assuming your USB will be drive &quot;E:&quot; on Windows; update your path if necessary):</div><div><br></div><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">install</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">packages</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;E:/lavaan_0.6-3.tar.gz&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> type </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;source&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> repos </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> NULL</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span></div></code></div><div><br><br></div><div><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div>Terrence D. Jorgensen</div><div>Assistant Professor, Methods and Statistics</div><div>Research Institute for Child Development and Education, the University of Amsterdam</div><div><a href=\"http://www.uva.nl/profile/t.d.jorgensen\" style=\"color:rgb(17,85,204)\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.uva.nl/profile/t.d.jorgensen&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792423489584000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1eC9o1RjXG5B-WH3n5sKRt\">http://www.uva.nl/profile/t.d.jorgensen</a></div></div></div></div></div><div dir=\"ltr\"><br style=\"font-size:small\"></div></div></div></div></blockquote></div>"
